/div>eine가 여성을 보여 줘서 형용사는 약변화처럼 -e예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Er wohnt seit Jahren in einem ruhigen Dorf an der Küste&quot;,&quot;Seit Jahren wohnt er in einem ruhigen Dorf an der Küste&quot;,&quot;In einem ruhigen Dorf an der Küste wohnt er seit Jahren&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그는 몇 년 전부터 해변의 조용한 마을에 살아요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">wohnt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Küste</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">ruhigen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Jahren</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">seit</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">einem</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">an</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">Dorf</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">Er</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"10\">in</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Er wohnt seit Jahren in einem ruhigen Dorf an der Küste.</b></div>in einem ruhigen Dorf — 3격은 혼합변화에서도 -en이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Ich habe leider keine <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Nachrichten für dich.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) gute</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) guter</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) guten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) gutes</button></div><div class=\"qe\">kein + 복수 → -en. 강변화 복수(gute)와 헷갈리지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Hast du meinen <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Regenschirm gesehen?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) schwarze</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) schwarzer</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) schwarzen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) schwarzes</button></div><div class=\"qe\">meinen이 남성 4격을 보여 줘요 → 형용사 -en.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;starken&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Zum Frühstück trinke ich immer <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(stark · Kaffee · 남성)</span> Kaffee.</div><div class=\"qko\">아침 식사 때 저는 늘 진한 커피를 마셔요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Zum Frühstück trinke ich immer <b>starken</b> Kaffee.</div>관사가 없으면 형용사가 정관사 끝글자를 붙여요. 남성 4격 den → starken.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Frisches&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(frisch)</span> Gemüse ist gut für die Gesundheit.</div><div class=\"qko\">신선한 채소는 건강에 좋아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Frisches</b> Gemüse ist gut für die Gesundheit.</div>관사 없는 중성 1격 → das의 s → frisches.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Wir backen den Kuchen mit <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Butter.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) weicher</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) weiche</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) weichem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) weichen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">mit + 3격, 관사 없음, 여성 → der의 r → weicher Butter.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> Spül das Glas mit <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Wasser aus!</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) warmes</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) warmen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) warmem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) warmer</button></div><div class=\"qe\">mit + 3격, 관사 없음, 중성 → dem의 m → warmem Wasser.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Abend, meine Damen und Herren!</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Gute</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Gutes</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Guten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Guter</button></div><div class=\"qe\">인사말은 4격이에요. der Abend → 남성 4격 강변화 -en.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Im Park spielen viele <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Kinder.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) kleine</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) kleinen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) kleiner</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) kleines</button></div><div class=\"qe\">viele 뒤는 강변화예요. 복수 1격 → -e.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&